        "created_at": "2014-07-31T18:45:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes for those that don't know, the illustrious MigrantP hails from our neighbor to the north. As a result, travel is sometimes more complicated or expensive which is why he typically doesn't make the trip to Gen Con. For me, it's just a short (well, 6 hour) drive. For him it's an international flight. But I look forward to seeing everyone again this year! I'll be arriving mid-day on friday.</p>",
